33:["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Yes. Melius has an in-app multi-track editor, so you can generate shots, arrange them, layer audio and export from one place rather than exporting individual clips to a separate editor."}]
34:["$","details","4",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Is Melius model-agnostic?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Yes. Melius runs every major image, video and audio model side by side and lets you pick the right one per shot. Its MCP server is canvas-level, so an external agent like Claude can build and run the canvas itself, not just request a single generation, which is a step beyond a generation-only integration."}]]}]
36:["$","$L35","post-magnific-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-magnific-alternative","slug":"magnific-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Magnific alternative for upscaling and creative AI","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Magnific alternative? Magnific's creative upscaler is a strong specialist, but if upscaling is one step in a real production, not the whole tool, and you'd rather not pay premium rates for a no-refund, credit-metered enhancer, here's how Melius folds generation, editing, resizing and assembly onto one canvas.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/magnific-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Magnific alternative?","answer":"Melius is the strongest alternative for teams. Magnific is a capable, well-funded platform, a real node canvas with an in-canvas agent, a timeline editor and model training on top of its best-in-class upscaler, so this isn't a canvas-versus-no-canvas comparison. The wedge is agent reach: on Melius the agent also runs inside Slack, the MCP is canvas-level so an external agent can build and run the canvas itself, teams teach it their brand as reusable slash-command skills, and self-serve plans include up to 8 seats, Enterprise includes unlimited seats, and agent usage is unlimited."},{"question":"Does Melius upscale and resize images like Magnific?","answer":"Yes. Melius includes magic resize and image enhancement as steps on the canvas, alongside background removal and other edits. The difference is that these live inside an end-to-end workflow: generate, edit, resize and hand off, rather than a standalone upscaler you round-trip through."},{"question":"Why do people look for a Magnific alternative?","answer":"Commonly cited reasons: it is priced at the premium end with no free trial and a strict no-refund policy, its creative upscaling can \"overcook\" images and invent detail that drifts from the original, and heavy trial-and-error burns credits. Its agent and MCP are also generation-focused rather than driving the canvas remotely, and there is no native Slack workflow, so teams that want an agent reaching across their whole stack look elsewhere."},{"question":"How does Magnific AI work?","answer":"Magnific is a creative upscaler: you feed it an image and it enlarges it while inventing plausible new detail, texture and lighting, with sliders to control how much it reimagines versus preserves the original. That hallucination is its strength and its risk, which is why control over how much it changes the image matters. In Melius, upscaling and enhancement are connected nodes in a larger pipeline rather than a standalone round trip."},{"question":"Is Magnific's upscaler better than Melius?","answer":"Magnific's creative upscaler is genuinely strong at inventing plausible detail, and for pure maximum-detail upscaling it is a specialist worth using. Melius optimizes for the whole creative pipeline instead of one step, so the question is less which upscaler wins and more whether you want a standalone enhancer or a workspace where enhancement is one connected node."},{"question":"Does Melius have a canvas?","answer":"Yes. Melius is built canvas-first: a node-based canvas where prompts, images, video and audio are connected nodes, with Mel to plan and wire the work and real-time multiplayer for teams."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-magnific-does-well","title":"What Magnific does well"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1067","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1066","text":"Magnific made its name as a creative upscaler, and it is still one of the best at it: push an image through and it doesn't just enlarge, it invents plausible new detail, texture and lighting, with sliders to dial how much it reimagines versus preserves.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1071","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1068","text":"It is no longer only an upscaler, though. Backed by Freepik's platform it has grown into a genuine node canvas with an in-canvas agent, a timeline video editor and model training, which makes it one of the closest tools to Melius in shape. So a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1069","text":"Magnific alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1070","text":" comparison can't lean on \"we have a canvas and an agent\" either. The honest differences are how far the agent reaches, how a team works on it at once, and how it plugs into your own stack. Here's a fair look.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1073","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1072","text":"What Magnific does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-magnific-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1075","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1074","text":"Magnific's creative upscaling is best-in-class at inventing detail, and its Mystic model, Relight tools and model training give real control over texture, lighting and consistency. Beyond that it now runs a live node canvas with multiplayer, an agent that wires and runs nodes, a timeline video editor and a huge stock library. It is a capable, well-funded platform, not a one-trick upscaler, and worth taking seriously.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1077","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1076","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1080","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1078","text":"The agent and MCP stop at generation. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1079","text":"Its MCP and integrations are described as generating assets rather than building or running the canvas remotely, and there's no native Slack workflow, so an external agent can make images but can't operate the canvas end to end for you.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1083","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1081","text":"Deterministic flows, not team skills. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1082","text":"Customization runs through preset flows rather than natural-language, team-defined slash-command skills, so teaching the agent your brand voice as reusable commands isn't really the model.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1086","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1084","text":"Detail that drifts. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1085","text":"The same hallucination that makes the upscaler impressive can \"overcook\" an image, inventing detail that diverges from the original, especially on photorealistic portraits.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1089","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1087","text":"Premium pricing, no free trial. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1088","text":"Users report no free tier to test with and a strict no-refund policy, so evaluating it means paying up front, and heavy trial-and-error burns credits.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1091","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1090","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1093","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1092","text":"Melius and Magnific overlap more than most pairs in this list, so the differences are about how far the agent reaches, not whether one exists.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1096","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1094","text":"An agent that reaches past the canvas. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1095","text":"Mel plans and runs multi-step work on the canvas and also inside Slack, so a request, an approval and a finished download can happen in the thread where briefs actually arrive, not only in the app.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1099","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1097","text":"A canvas-level MCP. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1098","text":"An external agent like Claude can build and run the Melius canvas itself, creating nodes, wiring them and executing, rather than only calling a generation endpoint. That's the difference between an agent that operates your workspace and one that just returns assets.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1102","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1100","text":"Teach it your brand, run many at once. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1101","text":"Give the agent brand instructions plus reference images and save custom slash-command skills, then run several agents concurrently with visible presence on the canvas, personalization and a workforce, not a single assistant.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1111","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1105","href":"/blog/best-ai-photo-background-editing-tools","isNewTab":false},{"_type":"link","_key":"b1108","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1103","text":"Resize and enhance in-line, one subscription. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1104","text":"Magic resize, image enhancement and ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1106","text":"background removal","marks":["b1105"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1107","text":" live as nodes, so an upscale flows straight into the next step, and every image, video and audio model shares ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1109","text":"one subscription","marks":["b1108"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1110","text":" with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1114","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1112","text":"Your own work, semantically searchable. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1113","text":"Past Magnific's stock library, every image you generate or upload is auto-indexed by content, so you find your own past work by describing it rather than remembering a filename or re-upscaling from scratch.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b1115","rows":[{"_key":"b1116","cells":[{"_key":"b1117","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1119","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1118","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1120","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1122","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1121","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1123","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1125","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1124","text":"Magnific","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1126","cells":[{"_key":"b1127","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1129","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1128","text":"Core focus","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1130","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1132","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1131","text":"Agent-run creative workspace","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1133","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1135","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1134","text":"Upscaling heritage, now a full suite","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1136","cells":[{"_key":"b1137","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1139","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1138","text":"Node canvas + in-canvas agent","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1140","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1142","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1141","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1143","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1145","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1144","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1146","cells":[{"_key":"b1147","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1149","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1148","text":"Agent in Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1150","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1152","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1151","text":"Full workflow in a thread","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1153","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1155","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1154","text":"Not native","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1156","cells":[{"_key":"b1157","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1159","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1158","text":"Canvas-level MCP","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1160","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1162","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1161","text":"Builds & runs the canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1163","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1165","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1164","text":"Generation-only","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1167","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1166","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1169","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1168","text":"If your job is squeezing maximum detail out of a single image, or you want the deepest timeline video editing, Magnific is a strong, well-funded choice and worth keeping in the toolbox. If the bottleneck is throughput across a team, an agent that runs the workflow in Slack and on the canvas, is drivable from your own AI tools, and learns your brand as reusable skills, Melius reaches further with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1174","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1171","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1170","text":"Put your whole workflow on one canvas. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1172","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b1171"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1173","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1176","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1175","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b1177","items":"$36:props:post:faq"}]}}]
37:["$","$L35","post-figma-weave-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-figma-weave-alternative","slug":"figma-weave-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Figma Weave alternative for generative design","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Figma Weave (Weavy) alternative? Weave puts a generation canvas next to your design files, great if you live in Figma. If you don't, the ecosystem coupling and fast credit burn become constraints. Here's how Melius compares as a standalone, canvas-first workspace with an agent and one credit pool.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/figma-weave-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Figma Weave alternative?","answer":"Melius is the strongest standalone alternative to Figma Weave. Both are node-based generation canvases with broad model access, but Melius is an independent creative workspace rather than a layer tied to the Figma ecosystem, it adds Mel to plan and wire multi-step work, and it keeps every model under one credit pool."},{"question":"How is Melius different from Figma Weave?","answer":"The biggest difference is the agent. Figma Weave has no AI agent, so its node graphs are wired and run by hand, and it is deeply tied to Figma's ecosystem. Melius is a standalone, agent-first workspace: Mel builds and runs the graph from a brief and also works in Slack, its MCP is canvas-level so an external agent like Claude can drive the canvas from any host, and every model shares one subscription."},{"question":"Is Figma Weave the same as Weavy?","answer":"Yes. Weavy was the original node-based generation canvas; Figma acquired it and rebranded it Figma Weave, folding it into Figma Design. So a Weavy alternative and a Figma Weave alternative are the same search. If you want that node-canvas-plus-generation model but without the Figma coupling, Melius is a standalone equivalent with an agent and one shared credit pool."},{"question":"Why do people look for a Figma Weave alternative?","answer":"The dominant complaint is credit cost: users report credits burning extremely fast, sometimes thousands of credits for a few minutes of work, with iterative fixes for AI mistakes eating more. There are also reports of billing friction on cancellation, and some tooling is still in open beta. Teams outside the Figma ecosystem also want a standalone option."},{"question":"Does Melius integrate with design tools?","answer":"Melius exposes an MCP server, so an agent like Claude can read and act on your canvas from your own environment. Rather than binding generation to one design suite, it aims to be model-agnostic and host-agnostic so it fits whatever workflow you already use."},{"question":"Can Melius sequence video like Weave's Timeline?","answer":"Yes. Melius includes an in-app multi-track editor for arranging shots, timing and layering audio, alongside the node canvas for building the generations that feed it."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-figma-weave-does-well","title":"What Weave does well"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1179","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1178","text":"Figma Weave, the product that started as Weavy before Figma acquired it, is a strong idea: a node-based generation canvas with real editing tools, compositing, masking, color grading, and a Timeline for sequencing, plus a set of one-click workflows surfaced right inside Figma Design. For designers who already live in Figma, having generation that close to their work is compelling.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1183","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1180","text":"That tight coupling is also the reason people search for a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1181","text":"Figma Weave alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1182","text":". If you don't live in Figma, or you want a standalone workspace with an agent and more predictable costs, the ecosystem fit becomes a constraint rather than a feature. Here's how Melius compares.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1185","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1184","text":"What Figma Weave does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-figma-weave-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1187","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1186","text":"Weave combines generation with genuine editing, compositing, masking and grading, not just prompt-in, image-out, and its node graph makes each step visible and re-runnable. The June 2026 Timeline brought video sequencing and sound onto the same canvas, and the embedded workflows make common design tasks a click away for anyone already in Figma. As a design-adjacent generation layer, it's well built.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1189","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1188","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1192","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1190","text":"No agent, fully manual. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1191","text":"This is the biggest gap. Where the rest of the field has some kind of AI agent, Weave's node graphs are wired and run by hand, so someone has to build every pipeline. There's also no announced Slack, MCP, API or CLI to drive it from elsewhere.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1195","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1193","text":"Credits burn fast. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1194","text":"A dominant complaint: users report thousands of credits consumed for a few minutes of work, with iterative fixes for AI mistakes, effectively paying to troubleshoot the tool, eating still more.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1198","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1196","text":"Ecosystem lock-in. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1197","text":"Weave's value is tightly coupled to Figma's world, and there's no audio or voice. If your team isn't Figma-first, much of the advantage doesn't apply.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1201","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1199","text":"Mid-acquisition uncertainty. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1200","text":"Some embedded tooling and the full Figma-to-Weave sync are still rolling out through beta, so the roadmap is moving while Figma folds it in.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1203","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1202","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1205","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1204","text":"Melius is a standalone, agent-first workspace, so the thing Weave leaves to you, building and running the graph, is exactly what the agent does.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1208","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1206","text":"An agent instead of manual wiring. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1207","text":"Mel reads your brief, picks a model per step, wires the node graph, runs it, and writes each per-model prompt, so multi-step work starts from intent, not hand assembly. It also runs in Slack and can carry your brand context and skills into every generation.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1211","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1209","text":"Drivable from your own tools. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1210","text":"A canvas-level MCP means an external agent like Claude can build and run the Melius canvas from your own environment, rather than binding your generations to a single design suite. Several agents can also work one canvas at once with visible presence.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1217","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1214","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1212","text":"Generation, audio and assembly in one place. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1213","text":"Image, video and audio models (including voice and music) live on the same canvas, with an in-app multi-track editor to sequence and export, all under ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1215","text":"a single subscription","marks":["b1214"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1216","text":" with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1220","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1218","text":"Real-time multiplayer for the team. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1219","text":"A whole team works the same canvas live, without depending on one design ecosystem's rollout schedule.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1223","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1221","text":"Assets you can actually find. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1222","text":"Every generation and upload lands in a semantic asset library you search by what's in the image, not a flat pile of files to scroll through later.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b1224","rows":[{"_key":"b1225","cells":[{"_key":"b1226","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1228","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1227","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1229","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1231","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1230","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1232","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1234","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1233","text":"Figma Weave","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1235","cells":[{"_key":"b1236","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1238","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1237","text":"Node-based canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1239","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1241","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1240","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1242","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1244","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1243","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1245","cells":[{"_key":"b1246","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1248","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1247","text":"AI agent","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1249","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1251","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1250","text":"Operates the canvas + Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1252","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1254","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1253","text":"None, fully manual","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1255","cells":[{"_key":"b1256","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1258","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1257","text":"Standalone or tied","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1259","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1261","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1260","text":"Standalone workspace","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1262","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1264","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1263","text":"Coupled to Figma ecosystem","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1265","cells":[{"_key":"b1266","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1268","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1267","text":"Drive from other tools","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1269","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1271","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1270","text":"Canvas-level MCP, any host","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1272","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1274","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1273","text":"None announced","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1275","cells":[{"_key":"b1276","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1278","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1277","text":"Audio / voice","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1279","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1281","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1280","text":"Voice, music & speech-to-text","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1282","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1284","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1283","text":"None","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1285","cells":[{"_key":"b1286","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1288","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1287","text":"Pixel editing depth","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1289","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1291","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1290","text":"Growing","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1292","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1294","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1293","text":"Deepest in class (a real strength)","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1296","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1295","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1298","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1297","text":"If your team is Figma-first and mostly wants the deepest pixel editing next to your design files, Weave's editing and integration are a real advantage. If you want an agent that builds and runs the pipeline for you rather than wiring every node by hand, drivable from your own AI tools, with audio and one subscription across every model, Melius is the more independent, agent-first home for that work.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1303","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1300","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1299","text":"Work on a canvas that isn't locked to one tool. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1301","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b1300"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1302","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1305","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1304","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b1306","items":"$37:props:post:faq"}]}}]
